Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:43.54,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Become all the more precious to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:47.44,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}You showed me many new things,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:51.60,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Crossing the fragmented moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:57.45,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:05.04,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\blur7\bord8\c&HD2EFF8&\1a&11&\3c&H44B5C1&\pos(960,720)}voluntary training
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:10.04,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, did you hear about Class D?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:13.05,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Right, about the exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:15.55,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,They did really well because of Sadako's notes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:18.47,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. Sadako's notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.14,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I actually want a copy of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:22.18,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:27.02,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:33.19,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, were you waiting for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.78,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:37.74,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:40.20,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,You're too nice, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:45.87,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Recently, it feels like I'm hearing\N rumors about Sadako wherever I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.46,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,There was that fight a little while ago, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:52.50,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,What's she really like, anyway? I don't really know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:55.84,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,We saw her with Kazehaya once, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:02:00.89,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah! We weren't sure whether they were dating or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.26,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:04.89,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:10.40,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It wouldn't really surprise me... if Kazehaya fell in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:15.74,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Like Kazehaya would fall for {\i1}her{\i0\fscx30} {\r}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:19.49,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,You know what he's like. He probably couldn't leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:22.58,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,And besides, wouldn't it make\N more sense that he likes {\i1}you{\i0\fscx30} {\r}, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:25.20,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.96,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Why not? You two are really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:30.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's only because we went to the same middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.92,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, why don't you just go out with him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:34.00,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.72,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you don't have feelings for him, he just might fall for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:41.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Recently, I feel as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:46.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...weird things have been happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:49.14,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:52.77,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Dude! Make a funny face!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.15,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,What? A funny face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:56.28,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:57.40,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:00.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:09.87,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it worked...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:11.21,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:16.88,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm too startled to smile, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:20.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy I'm not being avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.30,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:25.76,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,People are saying they'll be blessed\N with good luck if they make you smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:27.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:30.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first time anyone's ever said that of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:32.48,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll smile! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:38.53,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yo! Go tell Sadako a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:39.40,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:42.11,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Why did the duck cross the road?\N Because the chicken was on holiday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:43.07,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:48.91,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that worked...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.58,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Both the joke and the smiling myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.75,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you end up making that face when you try to smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.75,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.75,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:57.04,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Yano-san, Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:05.47,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You've become friends with\N Hirano-chan and Endou-chan, too, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,F-Frien-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:08.22,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.10,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:12.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Before I realized it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:16.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,These may be the happiest days of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:24.61,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's kind of a drag to call you two by your\N last names. Do you mind if I use your first names?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:26.87,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! Call me Ekko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.28,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Call me Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:31.79,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You can call me Chizu, and feel free to\N call her Yano-chin or Ayane or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:35.12,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! Chizu-chan and Ayane-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.29,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why, thank you so much for deciding for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,S-Smooth...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:40.84,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:41.88,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,What's smooth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So, as friendships progress, you\N start calling each other by first names!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much to learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.22,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No, it doesn't sound smooth at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:53.89,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,It usually just comes out of your mouth without you noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.15,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You memorized them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:58.06,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,Ekko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.19,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.11,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.53,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Ayane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.36,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You have to call us by those names, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:05.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.32,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.82,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A-A-A-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:11.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:14.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A-A-A-A-A-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:15.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Ayane-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:16.96,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Ch-Ch-Ch-Ch-Chizu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.17,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I think you added a few extra 'A's and 'Ch's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,E-E-Ekko-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:26.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,To-To-Tomo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:28.14,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that sounds nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.72,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:34.14,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,One more time, Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That made them happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:50.32,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're always so formal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.91,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you start calling other girls by their first names, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:55.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,By their first names?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think that's kind of rudely familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.17,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:02.59,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're really not used to these things, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.59,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it'd be weird to do it with someone you don't\N know, so why don't you start with people you do know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.22,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,And here comes a good guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:18.27,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Try calling him by his first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:14.93,Default-alt,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:15.39,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:16.64,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:18.27,Default-alt,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,By his first name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:21.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Y-Y-Yano-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:22.82,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,"Yano-san"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.78,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:25.82,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Ayane-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:27.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Th-That's way too difficult for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:31.53,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You think you'll be able to open up to everyone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:33.45,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yano-chin's a bit of a sadist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:36.04,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you said you were going to give it your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.12,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:41.96,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kazehaya, Sadako wanted to tell you something...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:42.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:43.79,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:48.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,K...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:50.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:51.97,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were going for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.85,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:02.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:03.86,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,"Kun"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:09.32,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,See? It'll be difficult to try it on guys, so you should start with girls first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:11.16,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're so forceful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:16.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That made me so nervous...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.70,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, so I should start with the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Right. I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:23.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll just refer to the guys as I normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:29.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so Yano just made her call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:30.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:30.51,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Was it a surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:38.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though Kazehaya-kun is always so nice to me like\N Yano-san and Yoshida-san, and talks to both guys and girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.59,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:38.97,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I did think it was a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.02,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,For Kuronuma to just call me "Kazehaya".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:44.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.40,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know what you were going to say to me after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:51.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But he's different from Yano-san and Yoshida-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how to explain it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:55.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He gives off...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...a very "guy" feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:06.50,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, today in homeroom, we're going to\N decide the committee rep for the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.38,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, it's too much of a hassle. The guy can just take the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.67,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,That's settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:11.88,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.72,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sucks to be you, Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.80,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't even have to run for the position!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:19.10,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better do a fine job!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:22.48,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and by the way, I'm also in charge of the committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.60,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't come to the meetings,\N I'll be telling everyone about your childh-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:25.65,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.61,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I know! I'll put effort into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:30.99,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,You guys better win the championship, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:35.24,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have enough people, so those who are\N good at sports have to participate in two events.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:38.12,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,If you're experienced in the sport,\N you {\i1}have{\i0\fscx30} {\r} to participate in that event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:40.08,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,If you suck, don't come on the day of the festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.83,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll mark you down as excused!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.46,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What a horrible teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:47.00,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And, just like that...
