Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.22,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:57.85,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show them what I'm made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.81,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,A festival just for me, held twice a year!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:04.10,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! You're fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.23,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:06.85,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.40,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,We'll defeat them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:10.61,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to make sure I don't ruin their chances...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.86,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma, have you ever played soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.45,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:24.29,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You do look unathletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:26.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.00,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to try that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.04,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,You can stay at home on the day of the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:38.22,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, do you guys want to take\N some time from lunch to practice, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.72,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:40.72,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:44.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That would really help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:46.64,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.69,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.99,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Practicing for the sports festival, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:02.70,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,It sounds like a drag, but it all seems fun if Kazehaya's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.87,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,He was pretty much forced into being the rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.71,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:26.31,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Our class has homeroom next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.98,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:30.06,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if we're deciding what sports to play for the festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:35.32,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of that, I heard Kazehaya's\N the committee representative for Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:36.94,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:39.82,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You should run for representative for our class, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:42.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.83,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:48.12,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,This may be the chance for you two to get together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.58,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.92,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you, that'll never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:55.09,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Although, I wouldn't mind becoming the rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.42,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Then do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:59.01,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't really want to run for the position...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:00.38,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.60,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We'll just nominate you! How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:04.64,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.31,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,No need to be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:12.90,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's all yours, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:14.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:26.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.66,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I kinda saw this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.34,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's a bit harsh making you play right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:39.59,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you start by practicing kicking the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.88,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.43,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, we thought you'd be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:48.60,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You should smile instead of looking pale, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.94,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,She may be able to scare off her opponent by laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:55.02,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,More like, we'll be blessed with good\N luck and end up winning the championship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:57.57,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:01.32,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,We should start heading back soon if\N we want to make it in time for fifth period.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.95,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, we've been out here for that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:05.70,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Our lunch breaks are so short!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:09.45,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,But other clubs are always using the field after school...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:14.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already getting in their way and all we've done is practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:17.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let them waste their precious time on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:19.59,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to practice on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.63,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get a soccer ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:23.55,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.43,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to practice on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:25.47,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What are you mumbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:26.39,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.83,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako's chanting something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.85,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get a soccer ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.39,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to practice on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:29.93,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:30.43,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.48,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,The guys are still at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.81,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:39.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.69,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:44.15,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,They're just horsing around like they always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:46.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like he's having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:49.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to see him playing sports!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:52.91,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what he's like when he's playing softball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:57.96,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You guys better finish up soon! You'll be late for fifth period!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.21,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:02.80,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We're heading back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:09.43,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I like your braids!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:14.48,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:15.19,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.37,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.63,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:49.51,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What are you staring off into space for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:51.01,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.43,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, your face is red!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:53.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.44,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You ran {\i1}that{\i0\fscx40} {\r} much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:01.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:05.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't really say anything special, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:07.70,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,We were pretty far away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.66,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He was just walking back...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:21.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...take my eyes off of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:29.72,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:31.89,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:34.10,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Finally! School's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:36.14,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go eat something, Yano-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.44,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You, too, Sadako! How about some ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.56,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.44,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Hanging out with you makes me fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:46.94,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,But more importantly, don't you have some shopping to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:50.57,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I need to buy a red t-shirt so\N I can stand out at the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.62,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're coming, too, right, Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:57.91,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I have some things I need to take care of, like watering the plants...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:14:59.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:00.62,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:04.17,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We don't mind waiting for you to finish up, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:06.17,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,And if we help out, we can get it done faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:09.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I'll be fine today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But... would it be all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:16.68,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...if I ask you to help me some other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:19.06,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. You can count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.02,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Then come shopping with us next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:28.65,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I know how nice they are. If I tell them I'm\N planning on practicing, they'll insist on helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:30.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they already have plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:34.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask you when you don't have any plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I really appreciate it, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:39.08,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya, where are you off to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.83,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I have to attend that committee meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:42.92,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:44.79,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sports festival rep, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:47.13,Default-alt,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, you were forced into that by Pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:47.96,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:52.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, what am I doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:17.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What? You want to borrow a soccer ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.95,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnArial Black\fs30\c&H806854&\fax0.05\frx5\fry4\frz356.041\pos(959,357)}SPORTS INSTRUCTION'S OFFICE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:20.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. It would be much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:22.25,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.58,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can't lend those out for personal use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:26.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You can't lend me a ball no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:28.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring it back! I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.09,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No means no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, so much for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:41.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I should buy my own ball, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:44.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll use my New Years money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:49.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Do the windows look okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.82,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:59.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is where I had my first real conversation with Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:27.94,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:30.44,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're on the committee, too, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:30.98,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:32.98,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You were nominated, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:33.94,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Glad I'm not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:37.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,We're both pretty unlucky, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.95,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That seat's open, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:40.53,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:44.75,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for that CD, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:46.21,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:49.25,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,There's actually an album I want to borrow from you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.29,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, I'll try to remember to bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:53.05,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:58.72,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Some band did a cover of the fourth song on the\N album before the one I lent you, and it's really good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.89,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You listening, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.89,0:18:06.64,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, what were you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:09.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,The album that came before the one I lent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:11.94,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha. I'll bring it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:38.80,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:04.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what time was that chime supposed to signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:48.62,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:08.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...but I can't smile naturally...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:23.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The air feels a bit different from usual...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:40.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So... instead of a smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:53.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want this ball to reach Kazehaya-kun.
